OL,3,GNEWSAMen jailed for 'abhorrent'
OL,4,Aoperation trafficking women from Europe
OL,5,Ainto UK for sex work
OL,6,
OL,7,FThe "architect and organiser" of a
OL,8,Fgroup that trafficked Romanian women
OL,9,Finto the UK to become sex workers has
OL,10,Fbeen sentenced to eight years and two
OL,11,Fmonths in prison.
OL,13,FGeorge Filip, 45, led an organised
OL,14,Fcrime group responsible for the
OL,15,F"prostitution" of at least 16 victims,
OL,16,Fearning hundreds of thousands of
OL,17,Fpounds, Cardiff Crown Court heard.
OL,23,APub: 30-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBWales NewsC Reg TVFClean Feed
FL,432,430,260,140,0,100
