OL,3,GNEWSAMen jailed for 'abhorrent'
OL,4,Aoperation trafficking women from Europe
OL,5,Ainto UK for sex work
OL,6,
OL,7,FHe was assisted by his wife Ionela
OL,8,FFilip, 35, to bring the women to work
OL,9,Fas prostitutes in locations across
OL,10,FWales, England and Scotland. Alexandru
OL,11,FMoco, 27 and Leonard Banica, 41, were
OL,12,Falso involved in the conspiracy.
OL,14,FJudge Francis said it was a
OL,15,F"substantial and sophisticated criminal
OL,16,Fenterprise that operated over seven
OL,17,Fyears".
OL,23,APub: 30-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
